You're human (I think since you have a +2 cloak of displacement) so
you can eat giant corpses until 18/** so there is no advantage to
gauntlets of power over the long term.  You should also start finding
leather gloves on human corpses soon enough (Minetown even) so I
wouldn't waste the wish unless you are in a big hurry to get the
amulet and get out.  In any case, you'd be better off with gauntlets
of dexterity.
